@YoujutsuSelfStudyPuzzle_16(ARG)
#DIM YJ16_LineCount
#DIM YJ16_Input, 2
; i think i have an idea for decay youjutsu
; so it'll be a questline
; there'll be three or four jars
; you can put meat in the jars
; over time the meat rots
; and when it rots you get youjutsu learning exp
;
;when you observe you get Decay Youjutsu learning
IF FIRSTTIME("YSSP17_FirstOpen")
;first time
;ahe: at home experiment
;acm: actmix camera line
;esg: experiment storage glass
VARSET YJ16_Item, -1
VARSET YJ16_Age
PRINTFORML You open up the package which reveals 3 jars, a digital camera with mounts, a memory card in a clear case, a manual, and a journal with pen.
PRINTFORMW You look at the manual and its cover.
{
CALL PRINT_LETTER(
@"--- MEAT ROTTING TIMELAPSE ---
\nAt Home Experiment
\nEnglish Edition
\n
\nBrought to you by eFun Technologies
\n
\n
\nSponsored by Nagoya City University
