\nAHE-0005M4-UM (FOR USE WITH SET # AHE-0005M4)
"
,,40)
}
PRINTFORMW You grab the manual and flip to the first page, marked red with a ton of bold lettering.
SETCOLOR C_RED
FONTBOLD
{
CALL PRINT_LETTER(
@"--- WARNING ---
\nProlonged exposure to rotting food can result in health complications including:
\n・Coughing
\n・Airborne infections, especially mold infections
\n・Vomiting
